{
  "ocr.recognize": {
    "notes": "OCR 验证码识别（M60 S1）。输入是「图片字节」，catalog 里**没有**任何命令能生成图片（screenshot 需要浏览器/桌面会话）⇒ 用例表无法用 pre 步自备 fixture。因此：① 需要真实图片的变体统一用**内联 imageBase64**（64x26 PNG，内容 58，876 字符，离线可复现）；② imagePath 变体用 {tmp} 占位路径，只承担**静态参数覆盖**，真实路径读写行为由 tests/contract/test_ocr_contract.py 用 PIL 现场生成图片覆盖（该测试进默认门禁，本表默认不被执行）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "image-path-is-accepted",
        "inputs": {
          "imagePath": "{tmp}/ocr/captcha.png"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "text"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "image-base64-recognizes-known-digits",
        "inputs": {
          "imageBase64": ""
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "text": "58"
          },
          "outputKeys": [
            "text"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "probability-adds-confidence",
        "inputs": {
          "imageBase64": "",
          "withProbability": true
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "text": "58"
          },
          "outputKeys": [
            "text",
            "confidence"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "empty-model-path-uses-builtin-model",
        "inputs": {
          "imageBase64": "",
          "modelPath": ""
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "text": "58"
          },
          "outputKeys": [
            "text"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "both-image-inputs-are-rejected",
        "inputs": {
          "imagePath": "{tmp}/ocr/captcha.png",
          "imageBase64": ""
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "INVALID_INPUT"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "neither-image-input-is-rejected",
        "inputs": {},
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "INVALID_INPUT"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-image-file-is-rejected",
        "inputs": {
          "imagePath": "{tmp}/ocr/does-not-exist.png"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "INVALID_INPUT"
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
